# Dart & Flutter style

## Analyzer

Follow `analysis_options.yaml` (`flutter_lints`). Run `flutter analyze` on touched paths.

## UI & layout

- User-visible strings: `AppLocalizations` via `lib/l10n/app_en.arb` — no hardcoded English in widgets.
- Prefer `flutter_screenutil` (`.w`, `.h`, `.sp`, `.r`) on layout pages.
- Colors / spacing: prefer `AppConstants` and `AppTheme` from `lib/core/`.

## State & navigation

- App-wide state: `Provider` + `ChangeNotifier` in `lib/providers/`.
- Navigation: `go_router`; `context.push` / `context.go` — routes live in `app_router.dart`.

## Networking & errors

- HTTP: `DioClient` + datasources in `lib/datasources/`.
- Throw / catch `ApiException`.

## Widgets

- Prefer `const` constructors and `const` widgets where possible.
- Private widgets: `_MyWidget` at bottom of file or in same folder.
- Page files stay focused; extract reusable pieces to `lib/widgets/`.

## Avoid

- `print` / `debugPrint` for production paths — use `LocalLogger` when logging is needed.
- Large unrelated refactors bundled with a small fix.
- Importing `pages/` from `widgets/` or `entities/` (dependency flows down: pages → widgets → entities).
